Package: theusualsuspects-je8086
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Roland JP-8000 emulation
 JE-8086 emulates the Roland JP-8000, as VST2, VST3, CLAP and LV2 plugins. It
